<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal drains 23.386 bln esc, 6.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal drains 23.386 bln esc, 6.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it drained 23.386 billion escudos of one-day funds from the money market at a fixed rate of 6.80 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
